    "api_info" : {
      "title" : "Get By Paging",
      "description" : "Retrieves a paginated list of MCP entries from the system. This operation allows fetching MCP data in smaller chunks using page number and page size, which helps in handling large datasets efficiently.\n\nInput Parameters:\npage (number): Page number to retrieve (usually starts from 1).\npageSize (number): Number of MCP records to return per page.\n\nOutput Parameters:\nmcps (array): List of MCP entries for the requested page.\nstatus (string): Status of the operation (e.g., success or failure).\nerror (string): Error message in case the operation fails."
    },
